            "review_title": "Review at Omakase Tiger",
            "review_text": "Jon N\nSinga5006 contributions\n0\nGood food, nice environment\nSep 2026 • Friends\nThree of us had the Omakase set dinner here food is good and prices are really affordable. Also have a nice view of the city. The staff is friendly and the chef explains every dishes. We opted for the 980k dong set plus sake pairing additional 580k dong each. Definitely worth a visit. Only have sitting for 9 people, so make sure reserved your spot\nWritten September 20, 2026",
