            "review_title": "Review at Omakase Tiger",
            "review_text": "Andrew Gyure\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam154 contributions\n0\nNeed more uniqueness and showmanship\nSep 2026 • Solo\nHad the full 14-course menu. Everything was good, but not exceptional. Nothing stood out to me as especially delicious or creative. There was no real showmanship displayed in the meal like so many other omakases. Waiter did a great job of explaining the sake parings. Printed cards were used to explain ingredients, which was helpful and educational. Room has nice view of city skyline.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten September 3, 2026",
