            "review_title": "Review at Omakase Tiger",
            "review_text": "Travelwithvivxo\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam7 contributions\n0\nBest Omakase in Saigon!\nMar 2024 • Friends\nI can’t rave about this place enough! Omakase Tiger checks all the boxes for me.\n\nPrice is 980k for Omakase and each dish was phenomenal! \n\nViews of Saigon while you’re having dinner is a huge plus for me. No omakase has this view in Saigon. Go see for yourself!\n\nLastly, the staff and service 10/10! they were all so attentive and explained each dish as it was coming out. \n\nI can wait to come back!!!\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten April 11, 2024\nOmakase Tiger\nThank you so much for enjoying our sushi, view, and team at Omakase Tiger! We appreciate your words so much and can't wait until you'll join us again soon for our next seasonal menu!\nRead more\nWritten April 23, 2024\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
